 "timeline": [
  {
   "turn_index": 0,
   "speaker": "Galina",
   "text": "Hello, everyone. Can you all see me? Rob, your camera's pointing at the ceiling.",
   "start_s": 0.5,
   "end_s": 6.1
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "Rob",
   "text": "Sorry. Better?",
   "start_s": 7.256,
   "end_s": 8.113
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "Galina",
   "text": "Much better. Katya, let's start with the day itself.",
   "start_s": 9.261,
   "end_s": 12.861
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "Katya",
   "text": "The garden venue is confirmed for June fourteenth, ceremony at three.",
   "start_s": 13.118,
   "end_s": 17.118
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "Misha",
   "text": "Three is perfect for photos. The light in that garden in the afternoon is beautiful.",
   "start_s": 17.403,
   "end_s": 22.697
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "Galina",
   "text": "And if it rains?",
   "start_s": 23.732,
   "end_s": 25.332
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "Katya",
   "text": "The venue has a tent we can rent. Nine hundred dollars.",
   "start_s": 26.268,
   "end_s": 30.268
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "Rob",
   "text": "Nine hundred for a tent. Well, it's cheaper than ruined dresses.",
   "start_s": 31.138,
   "end_s": 35.852
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "Galina",
   "text": "Do we have to decide about the tent now?",
   "start_s": 36.36,
   "end_s": 39.96
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "Katya",
   "text": "By the end of May. They need a week's notice.",
   "start_s": 40.766,
   "end_s": 44.402
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "Rob",
   "text": "Let's book it anyway. I'd rather not watch the forecast all week.",
   "start_s": 45.209,
   "end_s": 50.352
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "Katya",
   "text": "Thank you, Dad. I'll tell the venue on Monday.",
   "start_s": 51.133,
   "end_s": 54.406
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "Galina",
   "text": "Guests. We're at about eighty confirmed, I think.",
   "start_s": 54.764,
   "end_s": 57.964
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "Katya",
   "text": "That's close to the garden's limit. It holds ninety.",
   "start_s": 58.595,
   "end_s": 61.867
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 14,
   "speaker": "Galina",
   "text": "I have a few more names, actually. Your grandfather's cousins in Riga.",
   "start_s": 62.461,
   "end_s": 67.261
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 15,
   "speaker": "Katya",
   "text": "Auntie. I've never met them.",
   "start_s": 68.184,
   "end_s": 70.002
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 16,
   "speaker": "Galina",
   "text": "They knew you when you were a baby.",
   "start_s": 71.197,
   "end_s": 74.397
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 17,
   "speaker": "Rob",
   "text": "The RSVP deadline is the first of May. Anyone who hasn't replied by then isn't coming.",
   "start_s": 75.546,
   "end_s": 82.404
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 18,
   "speaker": "Galina",
   "text": "That seems harsh for family.",
   "start_s": 83.148,
   "end_s": 85.148
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 19,
   "speaker": "Rob",
   "text": "Maybe we invite the Riga cousins anyway and see who comes?",
   "start_s": 85.793,
   "end_s": 90.507
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 20,
   "speaker": "Katya",
   "text": "It's not harsh. It's a garden with ninety chairs.",
   "start_s": 90.975,
   "end_s": 94.248
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 21,
   "speaker": "Galina",
   "text": "All right. I'll send the Riga cousins a card, but no invitation.",
   "start_s": 94.484,
   "end_s": 99.284
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 22,
   "speaker": "Katya",
   "text": "Food. The caterer is fifty-five a head, buffet style.",
   "start_s": 99.511,
   "end_s": 102.784
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 23,
   "speaker": "Misha",
   "text": "Buffets are great for photos. People actually talk to each other.",
   "start_s": 103.449,
   "end_s": 107.331
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 24,
   "speaker": "Galina",
   "text": "And the cake?",
   "start_s": 107.849,
   "end_s": 109.049
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 25,
   "speaker": "Katya",
   "text": "Two tiers. Lemon on the bottom, chocolate on top.",
   "start_s": 109.629,
   "end_s": 112.902
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 26,
   "speaker": "Rob",
   "text": "The band is booked. A thousand dollars for the whole evening.",
   "start_s": 113.994,
   "end_s": 118.708
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 27,
   "speaker": "Katya",
   "text": "Dad, the contract you forwarded says fourteen hundred.",
   "start_s": 119.434,
   "end_s": 122.343
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 28,
   "speaker": "Rob",
   "text": "Ah. Fourteen hundred. They added the extra hour.",
   "start_s": 123.104,
   "end_s": 126.532
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 29,
   "speaker": "Galina",
   "text": "That's still reasonable for a whole band.",
   "start_s": 126.968,
   "end_s": 129.768
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 30,
   "speaker": "Rob",
   "text": "The neighbors should probably hear about the band before the day.",
   "start_s": 129.992,
   "end_s": 134.706
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 31,
   "speaker": "Misha",
   "text": "My friend's band played at my office party. They did a polka at the end and everyone joined in.",
   "start_s": 135.231,
   "end_s": 141.937
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 32,
   "speaker": "Galina",
   "text": "A polka! Your grandfather would have loved that.",
   "start_s": 142.274,
   "end_s": 145.474
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 33,
   "speaker": "Katya",
   "text": "Who's doing the photos? We haven't booked anyone yet.",
   "start_s": 146.184,
   "end_s": 149.457
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 34,
   "speaker": "Rob",
   "text": "Professional photographers are expensive.",
   "start_s": 150.656,
   "end_s": 152.37
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 35,
   "speaker": "Misha",
   "text": "I could do them, if you want. I'd love to.",
   "start_s": 153.244,
   "end_s": 156.774
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 36,
   "speaker": "Katya",
   "text": "Really? Misha, that would be amazing.",
   "start_s": 157.156,
   "end_s": 159.338
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 37,
   "speaker": "Galina",
   "text": "Then Misha does the photos. That's settled.",
   "start_s": 160.432,
   "end_s": 163.232
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 38,
   "speaker": "Misha",
   "text": "I won't let you down.",
   "start_s": 164.229,
   "end_s": 165.993
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 39,
   "speaker": "Galina",
   "text": "Travel. Where is everyone sleeping?",
   "start_s": 166.927,
   "end_s": 168.927
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 40,
   "speaker": "Rob",
   "text": "Nine cabins booked near the venue, a hundred and sixty a night.",
   "start_s": 170.034,
   "end_s": 175.176
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 41,
   "speaker": "Katya",
   "text": "Is that enough for the out-of-town family?",
   "start_s": 176.139,
   "end_s": 178.684
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 42,
   "speaker": "Galina",
   "text": "Nine cabins, two or three per cabin. That's most of them.",
   "start_s": 179.674,
   "end_s": 184.074
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 43,
   "speaker": "Misha",
   "text": "And the shuttle has thirty seats, from the cabins to the garden.",
   "start_s": 184.628,
   "end_s": 188.863
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 44,
   "speaker": "Rob",
   "text": "Thirty is plenty. Some people will drive.",
   "start_s": 190.044,
   "end_s": 193.044
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 45,
   "speaker": "Katya",
   "text": "Could someone make a map for the guests, with the cabins and the garden?",
   "start_s": 194.206,
   "end_s": 199.297
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 46,
   "speaker": "Misha",
   "text": "I'll make one. I'll put a little photo of the garden on it, too.",
   "start_s": 199.658,
   "end_s": 204.599
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 47,
   "speaker": "Galina",
   "text": "Is anyone picking up Grandma from the airport?",
   "start_s": 205.553,
   "end_s": 208.753
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 48,
   "speaker": "Katya",
   "text": "Thank you, everyone. This is going to be lovely.",
   "start_s": 209.668,
   "end_s": 212.941
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 49,
   "speaker": "Rob",
   "text": "It already is.",
   "start_s": 213.602,
   "end_s": 214.888
  }
 ]
}